{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "I don't want to believe I could hire a robber. It would bring down the whole city's reputation if I did that.": "",
  "You may not be the hardest working kid... But I don't think you're a robber.": "",
  "H-Hironaka-san...": "",
  "There's a lot at stake, huh? I'll see what I can do.": "",
  "Let's get one thing straight, though! I don't care if you're a detective, you can't see my stuff!": "",
  "(That just means I'm going to have to resort to logical deductions, I guess.)": "",
  "So they threw the costume away here.": "",
  "The costume and even the robber's belongings are strewn about... Let me get a closer look.": "",
  "You're right. I don't see them anywhere.": "",
  "Huh? That's odd... Something's missing.": "",
  "(What's missing that a robber dressed as Ono Michio would have in his possession?) ": "",
  "Ono Michio should have been wearing white gloves...": "",
  "I'd guess they got rid of them out of fear that they could trace his fingerprints from them.": "",
  "Any careful thief wouldn't leave such incriminating evidence lying around.": "",
  "And there's something else missing, too.": "",
  "Ono Michio should be wearing white pants, but they're not here either.": "",
  "Ah, I get it.": "",
  "Y-Yeah, you figured it out...": "",
  "That means the culprit is most likely still dressed in white pants.": "",
  "But there's something else missing too.": "",
  "Well, I changed into these when I went to the bathroom, but I forgot to switch back... Um, does that mean I'm a suspect?": "",
  "Ono Michio should be wearing a sash, right?": "",
  "O-Oh, is that right?": "",
  "...Uh, sorry.": "",
  "I guess you could always burn the gloves pretty easily, too...": "",
  "Now that you mention it, you're right. The robber was wearing white pants too.": "",
  "That means he's probably missing something else...": "",
  "Ono Michio should have been wearing jeans.": "",
  "Hey, what are you staring at?": "",
  "Really? I could've sworn...": "",
  "Heh, you really wanna see it? Fine.": "",
  "I don't see his boots.": "",
  "When a robber gets caught in the act, an employee can throw a paint ball at him to stain his shoes...": "",
  "Which means we should get a good look at each suspect's shoes.": "",
  "Yeah, I've got pockets for that.": "",
  "The bag in the hallway? What do you mean?": "",
  "This Ono Michio doesn't have that \"refined, mature look.\"": "",
  "Huh? W-Well, yeah. I have to wear them to play Ono Michio.": "",
  "So you texted your boss that you quit, and then threw away the costume?": "",
  "Likely story. You probably kept the costume so you could rob me.": "",
  "Th-that's not true!": "",
  "Nah, not really. Just thought I'd point that out.": "",
  "He must be a pretty tough act to follow, huh?": "",
  "Uh, sure... But there's no money in there.": "",
  "Where'd you hide my money, punk!?": "",
  "Everything that's missing are the white gloves, white pants, and... cool boots.": "",
  "Yagami-san! Don't keep us waiting!": "",
  "Yes. I got what I needed.": "",
  "There's enough evidence and deductions that can make a pretty compelling case here.": "",
  "The body tells us more about a person than you might think.": "",
  "(...Oh great, I'm starting to sound like a TV detective.)": "",
  "Wow! I feel like I heard a detective on TV say that!": "",
  "So, you gonna tell us!? Who's the robber, and where's my money!?": "",
  "(Okay. I'll accuse the person by talking to them.)": "",
  "Huh? You're saying you suspect me?": "",
  "(Is this the guy who did it?)": "",
  "(No, I'm not sure about it. Let me give it a little more thought.)": "",
  "Nah, just wanted to scare you.": "",
  "Yes. You're the Ono Michio Bandit!": "",
  "Me!? Where's your proof!?": "",
  "You left some evidence at the scene that clearly points to your efforts to cover it up.": "",
  "These sneakers were thrown away in the trash can.": "",
  "They're stained with the anti-theft paint ball, too.": "",
  "Yeah, I'm glad I thought to throw it at the thief.": "",
  "Anyone would know you'd committed a crime with this amount of paint on your shoes.": "",
  "So of course you had to ditch them.": "",
  "H-Hold on a second! What proof do you have that I'm the one who threw them away!?": "",
  "Stop playing dumb. There's proof on you right now.": "",
  "There is?": "",
  "That's right. You're wearing undeniable evidence.": "",
  "I-I told you, I went to the bathroom, and...": "",
  "That excuse isn't going to fly.": "",
  "You borrowed the Charles sandals because you threw away your stained sneakers, right?": "",
  "After all, the stain proves who the robber is.": "",
  "Admit it already. You're the robber.": "",
  "I don't know what you're talking about!": "",
  "Well, if you want to prove you're innocent...": "",
  "Why don't you lower the pant leg you rolled up?": "",
  "Ah! Ahhh! B-But that's...!": "",
  "I'm going to assume the hem of your pants has paint on it. If they don't, you can prove it right now.": "",
  "Gah... Grrr...": "",
  "Shiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiit!": "",
  "Huh? You're suspecting me?": "",
  "Wh-What!? Do you have any proof!?": "",
  "Of course. Why don't you take a look at this?": "",
  "And how exactly is that proof?": "",
  "Who knows? I just figured if you were the suspect, you'd say something stupid to give yourself away.": "",
  "What a dick! You can't just accuse me of something like that without putting any thought into it!": "",
  "(I should probably give this a little more thought.)": "",
  "What is it? You're saying I'm the suspect?": "",
  "'Scuse me!? You have proof, or not!?": "",
  "What the hell does that have to do with anything?": "",
  "Great question.": "",
  "You're fucking with me, huh!? I'll fuckin' kill you!": "",
  "Wait, what? You're really suspecting me?": "",
  "Th-Then, can I ask you to show some proof?": "",
  "Wait. How is that proof?": "",
  "Well, I thought it was. But you know, it's not very concrete, is it?": "",
  "Wooow. If you detectives have licenses, I think yours should be revoked.": "",
  "Whoa! Then that's really him...": "",
  "You're the thief!": "",
  "*sniffle*... Yes, I am.": "",
  "I'm sorry!!": "",
  "Why would you do something like that?": "",
  "I saw the costume lying there, and... I just couldn't help myself!": "",
  "My debts are due today, and I didn't have the money!": "",
  "So you thought you'd steal to pay them back? And you used some poor mascot to do it?": "",
  "I knew the costume would hide my face, and if I was lucky, the mascot would take the fall for it.": "",
  "Y-You've gotta be kidding me! You almost got me arrested!": "",
  "Uh, yeah. I'm sorry. I didn't even consider that they'd accuse a real person in the costume...": "",
  "Well, this one was no easy case to crack, but I think we're done here.": "",
  "Wait, so you paid your debts back already?": "",
  "Ergh... I didn't want it to end like this...": "",
  "Hey, where are you going?": "",
  "W-Well, you know. Look at me. Figured I'd get out of here before the cops came.": "",
  "(The case may be over... But... Is it really?)": "",
  "Besides, the case is solved. No need for me to stick around.": "",
  "Yeah, see ya around.": "",
  "I told you guys, this has nothing to do with this stupid little investigation!": "",
  "(He has a point...)": "",
  "Wh-What proof do you have of that!?": "",
  "No, the case...": "",
  "What do you mean by that, detective!?": "",
  "Wow, Yagami-san. You were really on a roll for a while there.": "",
  "Yeah, thanks for all your help, great detective Yagami.": "",
  "Don't call me that, please. It gets to my head and I start acting like one...": "",
  "I just hope the whole thing wasn't too damaging for Ono Michio's reputation.": "",
  "No way. We'll keep promoting him to make sure he stays refined and mature!": "",
  "Right, Nishimura-kun?": "",
  "Hironaka-san... Thank you.": "",
  "What are you thanking me for, all of a sudden?": "",
  "I threw away that costume and ran from the job, but you still believed in me the whole time.": "",
  "Of course I would, Nishimura-kun.": "",
  "I hired you to be Ono Michio because I could tell you were a sincere, honest kid.": "",
  "And I believed that one day you'd surpass even your predecessor and develop your own Ono Michio soul.": "",
  "Hironaka-san...": "",
  "But nobody can put this suit on and just wing it. It takes hard work to become a city's mascot. So don't let me down.": "",
  "Okay! I can at least michi half way!": "",
  "Now you're getting it!": "",
  "(Ono Michio, huh? I hope he makes everybody proud.)": "",
  "I haven't even looked in the hallway since this whole mess started, man.": "",
  "This is what proves you're the robber.": "",
  "You know... I was wondering that myself.": "",
  "What an ass! Don't call me out if you don't have proof!": "",
  "Your sandals are proof that you're trying to cover something up.": "",
  "What do you mean? I already explained why I'm wearing them.": "",
  "I changed when I went to the bathroom, and forgot to switch my shoes back.": "",
  "(I shouldn't show this now. He'll just bullshit his way out of it. I need something that's a little clearer.)": "",
  "Come on, detective! You can't just accuse me if you don't have any proof!": "",
  "No, I have evidence that proves how you tried to cover up the deed.": "",
  "This... is all the proof I need!": "",
  "Just when my debts were paid, and my life was finally looking up!": "",
  "Yagami-san, should we really be letting him? Isn't there something off about it?": "",
  "Something's still bothering me. I don't feel like we've solved everything!": "",
  "...Isn't finished yet!": "",
  "What did you just say!?": "",
  "Inamine-san.": "",
  "You've forgotten one very important point.": "",
  "The whereabouts of the stolen money.": "",
  "When I searched Kaneda-san's bag, it wasn't in there.": "",
  "Which begs the question, where did the money go?": "",
  "Th-That's...": "",
  "Which brings us to Kumakura-san...": "",
  "...And the bag he refused to let us see.": "",
  "I wonder what's in it?": "",
  "Oh, but I'd say it does. Because I think I know what you really are...": "",
  "You're a blackmailer.": "",
  "You probably threatened Kaneda-san to make him rob the place.": "",
  "I don't need any proof. I have... my instinct.": "",
  "Fuck your instinct! I'll fuckin' murder you!": "",
  "(I better rethink this before he totally loses it.)": "",
  "I knew you were the true culprit. You're the real robber, not Kaneda-san.": "",
  "But you just called him the suspect! How can you just change your answer like that!?": "",
  "I don't have proof, but you certainly look the part.": "",
  "You're dressed like a yakuza, and your face is clearly evil.": "",
  "Don't judge a book by its cover, asshole! I make do with what I've got!": "",
  "I should sue you for defamation!": "",
  "(Hm, I don't want to get sued. I better think this through a little better...)": "",
  "Kaneda-san mentioned that he'd finally paid back his debts...": "",
  "Yagami-san, that's weird, isn't it? He came here right after robbing the store, so how could he have done that?": "",
  "It's simple, really. The debt collector is right here.": "",
  "Uh oh.": "",
  "And that explains your role in this little tragedy, right, Kumakura-san?": "",
  "You're the debt collector, are you not!?": "",
  "Wait, then that means...!": "",
  "That's right. The contents of that bag...": "",
  "...Is all the money you were paid back!": "",
  "Gah!": "",
  "If I'm wrong, you'll have to show us what's in your bag.": "",
  "You piece of shit detective! I'm gonna end you!": "",
  "You think so? Come on then. From here on, I'll start proving things with my fists.": "",
  "And I'm pretty sure you're gonna get found guilty!": "",
  "D-Damn... How is some scrawny detective so strong?": "",
  "I get lots of practice on cheap thugs just like you.": "",
  "Now, let's see what's inside your bag.": "",
  "Quite a large wad of bills. So you're the one he owed, right?": "",
  "Right... Today was the collection day, so I told Kaneda to meet me here.": "",
  "He brought the 500,000 as promised, but I had no idea the dumbass knocked off a store to get it...": "",
  "Uh... My bad...": "",
  "But you must have realized it was stolen when this whole fiasco started, didn't you?": "",
  "Yet you still tried to hide it and run.": "",
  "W-Well, yeah, who wouldn't!? But, I get it! I lose! I'll return the money!": "",
  "What's your call, Inamine-san?": "",
  "Well, first thing I'm going to do is call the cops.": "",
  "That would mean the robber committed the deed in his own white pants.": "",
  "When Nishimura-kun wore the costume, he always brought his own white pants.": "",
  "Well, if he took them off, he'd be basically running around in his underwear, so he wouldn't have stripped.": "",
  "So I think it's safe to assume the robber was wearing his own white pants.": "",
  "Yagami-san, no! Ono Michio doesn't wear a sash! It would cover his trendy Ono shirt!": "",
  "His outfit is his soul! Please don't get the details wrong!": "",
  "No, no, NO! Ono Michio doesn't wear jeans!": "",
  "You're right! His cool boots, vital for any fisherman!": "",
  "If the clerk did that, we can safely assume the culprit's shoes would be stained.": "",
  "W-Well, I guess robbing a convenience store is neither refined nor mature...": "",
  "But is that really evidence we can use to find the culprit?": "",
  "Well, please don't say that in front of Nishimura-kun, okay? He's sensitive about it.": "",
  "Even the internet has come down on him for lacking the aggressive charm and mature wisdom his predecessor had.": "",
  "There's a chance the gloves were discarded, but the culprit may still be wearing white pants and the boots.": "",
  "I'm not sure... I believe the robber was wearing sneakers, not Ono Michio's cool boots.": "",
  "Would there happen to be any cash in this pouch?": "",
  "Well, it probably wouldn't still be there if there was.": "",
  "This is the knife the robber used. I doubt it's even worth checking for prints.": "",
  "That's right. Ono Michio wears gloves, after all.": "",
  "Yeah, my thoughts exactly.": "",
  "Hm, the bag is empty, so they've already transferred the money they stole somewhere else.": "",
  "Why would he switch bags, though?": "",
  "Hey, those sandals you're wearing...": "",
  "They say \"Charles\" on the heel. That's the arcade we're in. Did you win those here or something?": "",
  "We don't know anything for sure yet, but...": "",
  "You're also wearing white pants.": "",
  "Yeah, do you think I'm trying too hard? I'm going on a group blind date after this, and I wanted to look suave.": "",
  "You know how hard it is to make white pants work?": "",
  "That's why I went with ankle-length white pants to give off that really \"like I care\" look.": "",
  "Okay... That's one way to go about it...": "",
  "But then I top it all off with this cashmere cardigan that says, \"Hey ladies, I'm mature.\"": "",
  "S-So I see. I hope you do well at your date.": "",
  "(A tote bag. I can probably peek inside.)": "",
  "Feel free to have a look. I'm not worried.": "",
  "Sure, let's see what we've got.": "",
  "(A wallet with a few thousand yen and some candy.)": "",
  "See? Although I guess you could hide the real deal somewhere in the arcade.": "",
  "They're stained by the anti-theft paint ball. These must be the sneakers the robber was wearing.": "",
  "He knew he'd need to discard the shoes, so he ditched them. Damn.": "",
  "Yagami-san, don't forget, Ono Michio is supposed to wear cool boots, vital for any fisherman!": "",
  "I can't believe the thief went and committed a crime wearing sneakers instead...": "",
  "Yeah, I guess he was thinking more about how to get away than how to catch a fish...": "",
  "But the bad news is that the shoes might be a dead end. Our culprit isn't wearing them still.": "",
  "(He really didn't want me to see what's in this bag...)": "",
  "I just want to know, why are you so intent on hiding what's in that bag?": "",
  "You can pay the viewing fee with your life.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "There is?": "มีด้วยเหรอ?",
  "I don't know what you're talking about!": "ฉันไม่รู้ว่าแกพูดเรื่องอะไร!",
  "Th-That's...": "น-นั่นคือ...",
  "Uh oh.": "แย่แล้ว",
  "Gah!": "อ๊าก!"
 }
}
